    airo:evidenceText "Navya's 15-passenger Arma vehicles are also the stars of a similar program at the University of Michigan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "226" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5dfd19c89693> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[223] A driverless shuttle bus has been involved in a crash less than two hours after it was launched in Las Vegas." ;
