    airo:evidenceText "The shuttle, made by French startup Navya and owned and operated by French private transportation company Keolis, operates on a 0.6-mile loop around downtown Las Vegas offering free rides to residents." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "235" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8519e5ec105c> a airo:Evidence ;
